  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a name=\"top\"></a></span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_t.gif\" height=\"25\" width=\"630\"> <p><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"24\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/u.gif\" width=\"24\">O. \n                            Combat&amp;Jobs</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_m.gif\" height=\"39\" width=\"630\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:60%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background_1.gif\" height=\"22\">\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"590\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background.gif\">\n<p><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_steal/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">훔치기(Stealing)</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                            l&nbsp;</font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_hiding/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">숨기(Hiding) \n                             \n                            </font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">l&nbsp;</font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_stealth/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">은폐이동(Stealth)</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                            l&nbsp;</font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_snooping/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">훔쳐보기(Snooping)</font></a></span></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">은폐탐지(Detect Hidden)</font></span></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"\" bordercolor=\"#999933\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellspacing=\"0\" height=\"85\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"500\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"right\" class=\"heading\" width=\"595\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font>\n</p><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">하이딩 한채로 \n\n                        움직일수 있는 걸음수</span></b></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#999933\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"308\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" width=\"149\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스킬수치</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" width=\"149\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">걸음수</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"149\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">10</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"149\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">1</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"149\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">50</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"149\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">5</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"149\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">100</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"149\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">10</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15px;\"><font color=\"#313131\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">일단 하이딩한 \n\n                        상태에서 스텔스를 발동하시면됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15px;\"><font color=\"#313131\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스텔스 조건은 \n\n                        하이딩 80이상이실 때 배우실수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15px;\"><font color=\"#313131\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">위에서 보듯이 \n\n                        스텔스가 지엠일 경우는 10걸음정도를 숨은채 \n\n                        이동하실수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15px;\"><font color=\"#313131\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">물론 뛰지 않고 \n\n                        걸어야 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15px;\"><font color=\"#313131\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">처음 스텔스가 \n\n                        생겼을 때에는 사람에게 지나가도</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15px;\"><font color=\"#313131\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">하이딩이 풀리지 \n\n                        않았던 황당한 스킬이었습니다. 당시에는 집털이가 가능하였기에</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15px;\"><font color=\"#313131\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">주인이 문을열고 \n\n                        들어가면 스텔스 한상태에서 집으로 칩임 집주인이 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15px;\"><font color=\"#313131\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">다른곳으로 가거나 \n\n                        로그아웃하면 그집은 거의다 털리는 황당한 일이 벌어졌던</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15px;\"><font color=\"#313131\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">일이 종종 있었습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15px;\"><font color=\"#313131\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">간혹 예전 스크린샷의 \n\n                        예전집들을 보시게되면 집문안쪽에 상자나 탁자를</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15px;\"><font color=\"#313131\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">일렬로 세워두신 \n\n                        것을 보실수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15px;\"><font color=\"#313131\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">집주인이 하이딩이나 \n\n                        스탤스를 한 도둑을 위한 배려입니다</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15px;\"><font color=\"#313131\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">당연히 곧패치가 \n\n                        되었고 사람을 지나치면 곧 하이딩이 풀리게 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15px;\"><font color=\"#313131\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">물론 이스킬도 \n\n                        스틸,하이딩과 마찬가지로 아머의영향과</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15px;\"><font color=\"#313131\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">사람이나 몬스터에 \n\n                        밀집된 장소에 영향을 받습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15px;\"><font color=\"#313131\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">또한 말을 탄상태에서는 \n\n                        이동하실수 없습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15px;\"><font color=\"#313131\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스텔스가 실패시 \n\n                        물론 하이딩도 풀립니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#999933\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"250\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" colspan=\"2\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스텔스올리기</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Skill</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">AR</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Up to 60</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Up to 5</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">60-65</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">6</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">65-70</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">7</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">70-73</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">8</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">73-75</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">9</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">75-78</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">11</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">78-82</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">12</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">82-90</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">13</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">90-100</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">14</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#262626\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Written By \n\n                        Forg</span></b></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"298\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:8;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_skill/\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/menu.gif\" width=\"30\"></font></span></b></a></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"295\">\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"#top\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/top.gif\" width=\"20\"></font></span></b></a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_b.gif\" height=\"20\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/b_logo.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n"
}
